Package: telemaque
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi,
 gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.14), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gir1.2-glib-2.0, python3-libtorrent (>= 2.0)
Suggests: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: simple BitTorrent client for GNOME
 Télémaque downloads torrents, and only that, with libtorrent (the engine of
 qBittorrent and Deluge): .torrent files and magnet links, choice of the files
 to keep before and during the download, pause, resume, removal with or
 without the files, sharing until a chosen ratio, speed limits.
 .
 A sidebar sorts downloads (all, in progress, finished); a status bar shows
 the public address, the port and the DHT. A notification tells when a
 download is finished, and Télémaque can keep running in the background with
 an icon in the top bar. It follows the desktop theme (Adwaita, light/dark).
